Uh-uh, Princess.

981
01:27:36,849 --> 01:27:39,306
We're having you fixed.

982
01:27:39,516 --> 01:27:42,633
You're going to be
respectful, compliant

983
01:27:42,849 --> 01:27:46,171
and appreciative,
the way a woman should be.

984
01:27:50,141 --> 01:27:52,223
Mr cohaagen, telephone.

985
01:27:54,891 --> 01:27:56,506
Yes? What is it?

986
01:27:56,724 --> 01:27:59,306
"The oxygen level
is bottoming out in sector g.

987
01:27:59,516 --> 01:28:01,632
'What do you want me
to do about it?'

988
01:28:01,849 --> 01:28:05,797
- don't do anything.
- 'But they won't last an hour, sir.'

989
01:28:06,016 --> 01:28:08,348
fuck 'em. It'll be a good lesson
to the others.

990
01:28:08,558 --> 01:28:12,255
Come on, you got what you want.
Give these people air.

991
01:28:12,474 --> 01:28:16,217
My friend, in five minutes
you won't give a shit about the people.

992
01:28:16,433 --> 01:28:17,433
Fire it up, doc.

993
01:28:17,641 --> 01:28:19,632
Excuse me, doctor.

994
01:28:19,849 --> 01:28:21,885
- Is he gonna remember any of this?
- Not a thing.

995
01:28:23,016 --> 01:28:24,051
Oh, really?

996
01:28:34,641 --> 01:28:38,008
Quaid, I'm having a party tonight.
Why don't you and Melina drop by?

997
01:28:38,224 --> 01:28:39,680
- Remind him, doc.
- Sure.

998
01:28:39,891 --> 01:28:41,381
See you at the party.

999
01:28:56,141 --> 01:28:58,427
Keep still.
Fighting just makes it hurt.

1000
01:29:11,308 --> 01:29:14,015
If you don't keep still,
you'll end up psychotic.

1001
01:29:18,433 --> 01:29:19,639
Hey, don't!

1002
01:29:26,724 --> 01:29:28,305
Melina, hold on!

1003
01:29:51,308 --> 01:29:54,630
Are you all right?
Are you still you?

1004
01:29:54,849 --> 01:29:58,216
I'm not sure, dear.
What do you think?

1005
01:30:01,141 --> 01:30:03,678
Let's get the hell out of here.

1006
01:30:29,766 --> 01:30:32,007
You have to make a decision, sir.

1007
01:30:42,599 --> 01:30:43,759
Kill him.

1008
01:30:45,099 --> 01:30:47,090
It's about goddamn time.

1009
01:31:39,391 --> 01:31:41,973
- Where are you going?
- To the reactor.

1010
01:31:42,183 --> 01:31:45,755
- What reactor?
- The one in the mines. Come on!

1011
01:31:45,974 --> 01:31:49,887
People are dying, quaid!
Stop! We've got to get air!

1012
01:31:50,099 --> 01:31:53,171
The reactor makes air.
That's cohaagen's secret. Let's go.

1013
01:31:53,391 --> 01:31:54,756
Where's this reactor come from?

1014
01:31:54,974 --> 01:31:56,885
- Aliens built it.
- Aliens?

1015
01:31:57,099 --> 01:32:00,466
- Are you sure about this?
- It's just up ahead.

1016
01:32:03,099 --> 01:32:05,306
What the hell?

1017
01:32:28,766 --> 01:32:32,714
Quaid! Hey, quaid,
you remember me?

1018
01:32:32,933 --> 01:32:35,140
Benny! Benny's the name!

1019
01:32:49,391 --> 01:32:50,756
Oh, that's good!

1020
01:32:56,641 --> 01:33:00,839
I'm gonna drill you, sucker!
I'm gonna grind you up!

1021
01:33:06,641 --> 01:33:09,883
Ha-ha! I'm coming!

1022
01:33:10,099 --> 01:33:11,635
I'm coming for you, baby!

1023
01:33:27,391 --> 01:33:29,347
What the fuck is this?

1024
01:33:36,016 --> 01:33:38,007
Damn this piece of martian junk!

1025
01:33:40,391 --> 01:33:42,803
Hey, quaid,
I'm gonna squash you!

1026
01:33:44,183 --> 01:33:46,014
Benny, here!

1027
01:33:49,266 --> 01:33:50,802
Where the fuck are you?

1028
01:33:56,599 --> 01:33:58,214
Screw you!

1029
01:34:04,391 --> 01:34:08,213
- Quaid, get over here!
- What is it?

1030
01:34:09,266 --> 01:34:13,054
- There's an opening.
- I knew it.

1031
01:34:41,891 --> 01:34:45,054
This whole thing is one big reactor
made out of terbinium.

1032
01:34:45,266 --> 01:34:48,463
Cohaagen knows it makes air.
The bastard won't turn it on.

1033
01:34:48,683 --> 01:34:53,302
Of course not. If Mars had
an atmosphere, he'd lose control.

1034
01:34:54,183 --> 01:34:55,423
See down there?

1035
01:34:56,683 --> 01:34:58,969
It's a glacier.

1036
01:34:59,183 --> 01:35:02,175
The whole core of Mars is ice.

1037
01:35:02,391 --> 01:35:06,555
The reactor melts it
and it releases the oxygen.

1038
01:35:06,766 --> 01:35:07,972
Come on.

1039
01:35:08,183 --> 01:35:11,050
- Enough for everyone to breathe?
- Sure.

1040
01:35:11,266 --> 01:35:14,053
Enough for the whole planet.

1041
01:35:14,266 --> 01:35:16,552
If we turn it on in time.

1042
01:35:23,183 --> 01:35:25,174
Come on. Come on!

1043
01:35:42,099 --> 01:35:43,214
Hold on.

1044
01:36:14,683 --> 01:36:16,093
Now!

1045
01:36:45,933 --> 01:36:47,093
Son of a bitch.

1046
01:36:54,933 --> 01:36:56,594
Move!

1047
01:36:59,349 --> 01:37:01,385
He's got a hologram!

1048
01:37:23,349 --> 01:37:25,886
You think this is
the real quaid? It is.

1049
01:38:45,599 --> 01:38:47,806
You're coming with me!

1050
01:39:42,058 --> 01:39:46,472
- Don't touch that! Get back!
- What are you afraid of?

1051
01:39:46,683 --> 01:39:48,924
- Turn it on.
- Impossible!

1052
01:39:49,141 --> 01:39:52,178
Once the reaction starts, it'll spread
to all the terbinium in the planet.

1053
01:39:52,391 --> 01:39:54,552
Mars will go into global meltdown.

1054
01:39:54,766 --> 01:39:57,257
That's why the aliens
never turned it on.

1055
01:39:57,474 --> 01:39:59,430
And you expect me to believe you?

1056
01:39:59,641 --> 01:40:04,180
Who gives a shit what you believe?
In 30 seconds you'll be dead.

1057
01:40:04,391 --> 01:40:07,554
Then I'll blow this place up
and be home in time for cornflakes.

1058
01:40:11,308 --> 01:40:15,176
I didn't want it to end this way.
I wanted hauser back. But no.

1059
01:40:16,599 --> 01:40:18,555
You had to be quaid!

1060
01:40:18,766 --> 01:40:21,098
- I am quaid.
- You're nothing!

1061
01:40:21,308 --> 01:40:24,300
You're nobody!
You're a stupid dream.

1062
01:40:24,516 --> 01:40:28,384
Well, all dreams come to an end.

1063
01:41:43,224 --> 01:41:45,431
Melina, hold on!

1064
01:41:45,641 --> 01:41:49,179
Don't do it! We'll all die!

1065
01:41:50,183 --> 01:41:52,515
Everybody will die!

1066
01:42:55,641 --> 01:42:57,051
Quaid!

1067
01:48:11,933 --> 01:48:14,595
I can't believe it.
It's like a dream.

1068
01:48:15,641 --> 01:48:17,097
What's wrong?

1069
01:48:17,308 --> 01:48:21,130
I just had a terrible thought.
What if this is a dream?

1070
01:48:22,641 --> 01:48:26,133
Well, then kiss me quick
before you wake up.

